return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:59+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:59+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Sayar da Zinn Digital® hosting daga shafin ku na WordPress — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud da VPS hosting. Nemi kuma ku ba da yankuna daga asusun ku na reseller, sanya abokan cinikin ku kai tsaye cikin rukunin hosting dinsu, kuma ku samar da hosting ta atomatik lokacin da aka biya oda ta WooCommerce.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Dandalin karbar bakuncin yanar gizo ya amsa da matsayi %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Nemo sunan domain ɗinka','Search'=>'Nemoƙa','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Ba a duba wata ƙari ba don wannan suna.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Binciken yanki ba ya samuwa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon a halin yanzu.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga rajistar yankin a yanzu ba. Don Allah a sake gwadawa nan da dan lokaci.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Settings → Zinn® Reseller.'=>'An bace maɓallin API ko kuma ba ya aiki. Duba shi a ƙarƙashin Saituna → Zinn® Reseller.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Wannan maɓallin API ɗin ba shi da izinin sites.view, wanda binciken yanki ke buƙata. Ƙara shi zuwa ga maɓallin a cikin rukunin dillalin ku, ko share maɓallin a nan don komawa zuwa binciken jama\'a.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Masu gudanarwa kawai ke ganin wannan:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba — sake gwadawa','Already registered'=>'An riga an yi rajista','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Akwai — tambaye mu farashi','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Akwai — %1$s %2$s na shekara ta farko','Register it'=>'Yi rijistar sa','Manage my hosting'=>'Gudanar da abubuwan daukar shafina na yanar gizo','Please sign in first.'=>'Da fatan za a fara shiga ciki.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Ba a haɗa wannan asusun da sabis na ɗaukar shafuka ba tukuna.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Dandaminin ajiyar shafin bai dawo da hanyar shiga ba.','Zinn® Reseller'=>'Zinn® Reseller','Settings'=>'Saituna','Connect this site to your Zinn® reseller account, then switch on only the parts you need.'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin yanar gizon zuwa asusun dillalin ku na Zinn®, sannan ku kunna sassan da kuke buƙata kawai.','API key'=>'Maɓullin API','Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under API keys. Give it only the permissions the modules below need.'=>'Ƙirƙiri ɗaya a cikin allon sarrafa ku na Zinn® a ƙarƙashin maɓallan API. Ba shi izini kawai waɗanda kayan aikin da ke ƙasa ke buƙata.','API address'=>'Adreshin API','Panel address'=>'Adireshin panel','Where your clients are sent to manage their hosting. If you have set a panel hostname under Reselling → Your brand, put it here — your clients then never see our address at all.'=>'Inda ake tura abokan cinikin ku don sarrafa gidan yanar gizon su. Idan kun saita su