platform did not return a client account.'=>'Dandalin karbar bakuncin yanar gizo bai dawo da asusun abokin ciniki ba.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Ba a ba da damar Zinn® hosting ba: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Layin samfuran Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Layin samfurin Zinn® wanda za a samar lokacin da aka sayi wannan samfurin. Bar shi a fanko don amfani da tsohuwa daga saitunan plugin din.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Zinn® hosting','Service id'=>'Lambar hidima','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Ba abin da aka tsara don wannan oda.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, ajiyar bayanai ta yau da kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma wani kwamitin sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke gudanar da fiye da shafi ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da aka kafa, yankuna, da wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da riƙe kuɗin lafiya har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — dauki ma\'aikatan da suke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi ciniki.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba